{
    "title": "Would u Rather? Party Game",
    "description": "What Would You Rather Choose is a fun party game where you have to choose between two difficult scenarios.\r\n\r\nThe rules are simple. All you need to do is to click on the option you would rather choose.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2605 Features \u2605\u2605\r\n\u2714 Hundreds of interesting and challenging would you rather questions\r\n\u2714 Vote for the option you would rather pick and view statistics on what one is more popular\r\n\u2714 Perfect party game to play with friends\r\n\u2714 Frequently updated with more would you rather questions\r\n\u2714 Completely free to play\r\n\u2714 Addicting and funny\r\n\u2714 Fun game to play when you are bored\r\n\u2714 Perfect group game but can also be played alone.\r\n\u2714 Lots of hard and difficult questions to answer by yourself or in debate in a group\r\n\u2714 Great game for dating or playing with groups of friends and family\r\n\u2714 Offline mode making this the perfect road trip game. No Wifi connection or internet connection is required to play. This is one of the best apps that doesn't need wifi\r\n\u2714 Separate adults mode for anyone wanting to play with dirty questions (18+)\r\n\r\nWhat Would You Rather Choose is a great party game to play with a group of friends rather than playing just by yourself. What option would you rather pick? Grab your friends and play a game of What Would You Rather Choose to find out. It's the ultimate app for any party or road trip.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2605 Multiple Decks \u2605\u2605\r\nThere are so many decks to choose from\r\n\u2714 Entertainment\r\n\u2714 Random\r\n\u2714 Weird\r\n\u2714 Funny\r\n\u2714 College\r\n\u2714 Deep\r\n\u2714 Boyfriend/Girlfriend\r\n\u2714 Gross\r\n\u2714 Popular\r\n\u2714 Sports\r\n\u2714 Girls/Boys\r\n\r\nAnswer fun questions such as:\r\n- Would you rather always be 10 minutes late or always be 20 minutes early?\r\n- Would you rather go back 10 years in past or go forward 10 years in the future?\r\n\r\nHundreds of difficult Would You Rather questions await! Can you answer them all? This party game can also be known as This or That. If you are having a road trip this is the perfect app to download since it can be played offline.\r\n\r\nIf you are bored this is a great fun and addicting app to download. It also great for road trips and parties since it works offline with no Wifi.\r\n\r\nEnjoy playing the best and most addicting Would You Rather game today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "What Would You Rather Choose is a fun party game where you have to choose between two difficult scenarios.<br><br>The rules are simple. All you need to do is to click on the option you would rather choose.<br><br>\u2605\u2605 Features \u2605\u2605<br>\u2714 Hundreds of interesting and challenging would you rather questions<br>\u2714 Vote for the option you would rather pick and view statistics on what one is more popular<br>\u2714 Perfect party game to play with friends<br>\u2714 Frequently updated with more would you rather questions<br>\u2714 Completely free to play<br>\u2714 Addicting and funny<br>\u2714 Fun game to play when you are bored<br>\u2714 Perfect group game but can also be played alone.<br>\u2714 Lots of hard and difficult questions to answer by yourself or in debate in a group<br>\u2714 Great game for dating or playing with groups of friends and family<br>\u2714 Offline mode making this the perfect road trip game. No Wifi connection or internet connection is required to play. This is one of the best apps that doesn&#39;t need wifi<br>\u2714 Separate adults mode for anyone wanting to play with dirty questions (18+)<br><br>What Would You Rather Choose is a great party game to play with a group of friends rather than playing just by yourself. What option would you rather pick? Grab your friends and play a game of What Would You Rather Choose to find out. It&#39;s the ultimate app for any party or road trip.<br><br>\u2605\u2605 Multiple Decks \u2605\u2605<br>There are so many decks to choose from<br>\u2714 Entertainment<br>\u2714 Random<br>\u2714 Weird<br>\u2714 Funny<br>\u2714 College<br>\u2714 Deep<br>\u2714 Boyfriend/Girlfriend<br>\u2714 Gross<br>\u2714 Popular<br>\u2714 Sports<br>\u2714 Girls/Boys<br><br>Answer fun questions such as:<br>- Would you rather always be 10 minutes late or always be 20 minutes early?<br>- Would you rather go back 10 years in past or go forward 10 years in the future?<br><br>Hundreds of difficult Woul